2. src/main/resources
--> Application Settings Folder
--> Stores everything that is NOT Java code

3. src/test/java
--> Contains test classes
--> Testing, Bug Detection and Quality Checking
--> verifies whether your application works correctly

4. src/test/resources
--> Contains files needed during testing

5. JRE System Library
--> Contains Java libraries like String, ArrayList, HashMap, 
    Scanner, Exception and Collections

6. pom.xml : The heart of Maven
             POM means Project Object Model
             It tells Maven Project Name, Dependencies, Java Version and Build Information

